# ai_agent_companion .gitignore
# === 运行时数据 ===
**/data/
**/logs/
**/*.log

# === 敏感配置（example 文件入库，真实配置严禁入库） ===
**/.env
**/config.yaml
**/extensions_config.json

# === Python ===
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/*.so
**/.Python
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.egg
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
# PEP 420 namespace 包：backend/src/packages/ 不应有 __init__.py
# （保持 packages 命名空间跨目录拼接）
backend/src/packages/__init__.py

# === Pixi ===
**/.pixi/

# === 测试 / 静态检查缓存 ===
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/coverage/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage.xml
**/coverage.json
**/lcov
**/dump.rdb
frontend/test-results/
**/node_modules/

# === Alembic 迁移（迁移文件必须入库，仅忽略缓存） ===
**/alembic/versions/__pycache__/

# === IDE / 工具 ===
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/.codegraph

# === 研究产物 / 内部规划 ===
**/.omo/
**/.opencode/
**/.zcode/
**/.live-test/
artifacts/
**/tests-logs.log
